# Package this machine's ComfyUI install into a Comfy build

Turn the ComfyUI install on this machine into a build on the Comfy developer platform, then cut a release of it. Run this on the machine that holds ComfyUI, its models and its custom nodes.

The developer has called this build: build-cm6pjr

## Read the skill, then follow it

```bash
pip install -U comfy-cli
comfy skills show comfy-build
```

The skill is the procedure: how to scan the install, what to pin, how to record the model and node policy, what to disclose before a cut, when to sign in, and what to do when a build fails. Follow it rather than guessing an invocation.

## If you cannot run any of this

The developer can build in the browser instead:
